agent-switchboard.ts:1: /**
agent-switchboard.ts:2:  * The switchboard tools a project agent gets: talk to the caller, hand them
agent-switchboard.ts:3:  * back, or put them straight through to another project.
agent-switchboard.ts:4:  *
agent-switchboard.ts:5:  * This file is not installed on project hosts by configuration management —
agent-switchboard.ts:6:  * several of them are not Ansible-managed. The switchboard copies it into a
agent-switchboard.ts:7:  * cache directory under the ssh user's home the first time it connects to a
agent-switchboard.ts:8:  * host, then starts pi with `-e <that path>` (see pbx.Switchboard._stage_extension).
agent-switchboard.ts:9:  * If that copy fails, the agent's system prompt tells it to emit a sentinel line
agent-switchboard.ts:10:  * instead, which needs nothing installed on the far end.
agent-switchboard.ts:11:  *
agent-switchboard.ts:12:  * Deliberately not MCP. Pi has no built-in MCP support because tool definitions
agent-switchboard.ts:13:  * are expensive context, and an adapter would mean another config file, another
agent-switchboard.ts:14:  * process, and another thing to install on every project host. A tool the
agent-switchboard.ts:15:  * switchboard already ships to every host it connects to has none of those
agent-switchboard.ts:16:  * problems.
agent-switchboard.ts:17:  *
agent-switchboard.ts:18:  * `return_to_operator`, `transfer_to_project` and `set_model` do not themselves
agent-switchboard.ts:19:  * move anyone — the switchboard sees the call in pi's RPC event stream and
agent-switchboard.ts:20:  * swings the line. `set_model` especially: an agent cannot restart itself onto
agent-switchboard.ts:21:  * another model, because the process it would have to replace is the one making
agent-switchboard.ts:22:  * the call. `speak` is the opposite: it does the real work here, because audio
agent-switchboard.ts:23:  * has to reach the caller *now*, mid-turn, rather than whenever the turn
agent-switchboard.ts:24:  * happens to settle.
agent-switchboard.ts:25:  *
agent-switchboard.ts:26:  * There is no `list_projects` here to match the operator's set: a project host
agent-switchboard.ts:27:  * cannot read the switchboard's registry, so the extensions an agent may hand
agent-switchboard.ts:28:  * the caller to are named in its system prompt instead.
agent-switchboard.ts:29:  */
